window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Briar needs help.</b></p> <p>She knows what it's like to walk out of a dangerous situation and straight into the unknown. That's what brings her to Shadow Security—only a case of mistaken identity leads her to accept a job that was never actually intended for her.</p> <p>Things look up when she catches the eye of one of the guys at work, but they take a downturn fast when she realizes he has no intention of staying faithful. Luckily, her handsome coworkers are there to help pick up the pieces, but everything compounds as the past catches up at the worst possible time.</p> <p>Briar doesn't want to run again, but she has big secrets that her overbearing boss and mercenary coworkers know nothing about.</p> <p>Shadow Security didn't earn its reputation as one of the most ruthless private security companies in the country for nothing, but will that be enough? Will they even want to protect her when they realize how high the stakes are, and who they're truly up against?</p> <p>Whatever It Takes <i>is a complete standalone with no cliffhanger.</i></p>"; 
